WEBVTT

00:17.720 --> 00:18.810
<b>Makoto! Here!</b>

00:28.440 --> 00:31.400
<b><i>All ground forces surround the premises.</i></b>

00:32.400 --> 00:34.280
<b>Use all available resources.</b>

00:35.200 --> 00:37.120
<b>Do not fail this time
to secure her unharmed.</b>

00:38.370 --> 00:39.200
<b><i>Roger that.</i></b>

00:42.160 --> 00:46.420
<b><i>Threat threshold has been crossed.</i>
<i>Activate Ingress now.</i></b>

02:22.970 --> 02:24.470
<b>The exit’s up ahead! Hurry!</b>

02:24.970 --> 02:25.810
<b>What are we gonna do?</b>

02:26.470 --> 02:27.930
<b>The mountains are our best bet.</b>

02:33.730 --> 02:34.570
<b>No!</b>

02:34.980 --> 02:35.820
<b>Dammit!</b>

02:40.860 --> 02:41.700
<b>Makoto!</b>

02:47.580 --> 02:48.790
<b>No! Don’t shoot!</b>

02:49.120 --> 02:49.960
<b>Move it!</b>

02:50.040 --> 02:51.250
<b>Wait! Hold your fire!</b>

02:52.540 --> 02:54.290
<b>We need to bring the target in unharmed.</b>

02:59.380 --> 03:00.220
<b>Shit!</b>

03:04.390 --> 03:07.060
<b><i>Charlie team.</i>
<i>Target is moving to the roof of Area C.</i></b>

03:07.140 --> 03:08.140
<b>-Get moving!
-Roger!</b>

03:14.690 --> 03:15.520
<b>The hell?</b>

03:45.010 --> 03:46.010
<b>No!</b>

03:46.100 --> 03:48.510
<b>You, keep going. Continue without me.</b>

03:48.600 --> 03:51.430
<b>Are you out of your mind?
I’m your best chance of staying alive.</b>

04:06.370 --> 04:07.280
<b>What's that?</b>

04:18.340 --> 04:22.300
<b>That helicopter is bad news.</b>

04:32.060 --> 04:32.890
<b>It’s you...</b>

04:34.890 --> 04:37.940
<b>You have been
extremely troublesome, Sarah.</b>

04:51.200 --> 04:52.040
<b>Back off!</b>

04:53.000 --> 04:54.660
<b>Wait... Hold.</b>

04:55.290 --> 04:57.170
<b>I'm the one you want, right?</b>

04:58.250 --> 05:00.590
<b>So let him go! He’s not your target.</b>

05:02.050 --> 05:02.880
<b>Please.</b>

05:09.510 --> 05:10.430
<b>Fine. As you wish.</b>

05:10.850 --> 05:12.310
<b>All teams, stand down.</b>

05:13.640 --> 05:14.520
<b>Do it!</b>

05:14.930 --> 05:15.770
<b>Yes sir!</b>

05:19.520 --> 05:20.400
<b>Come.</b>

05:26.450 --> 05:27.280
<b>It’s the only way.</b>

05:31.990 --> 05:33.240
<b>That’s a good girl, Sarah.</b>

05:34.410 --> 05:36.410
<b>Now... let Makoto go free.</b>

05:41.130 --> 05:42.670
<b>You can’t hide your fear from me.</b>

05:44.630 --> 05:45.470
<b>Sarah!</b>

05:47.090 --> 05:47.930
<b>What?</b>

05:49.300 --> 05:52.600
<b>Make sure you get rid of
that bag of trash there.</b>

05:53.770 --> 05:54.600
<b>Makoto!</b>

05:55.350 --> 05:56.180
<b>Don’t hurt her!</b>

05:57.350 --> 05:59.060
<b>You said you’d let him go!</b>

05:59.150 --> 05:59.980
<b>Fire.</b>

06:16.750 --> 06:17.660
<b>You’re alive?</b>

06:46.150 --> 06:46.980
<b>Dammit!</b>

06:53.950 --> 06:55.200
<b>You just gonna watch, trash boy?</b>

06:55.450 --> 06:56.290
<b>What?</b>

06:56.950 --> 06:57.790
<b>This is your fault.</b>

06:59.120 --> 06:59.960
<b>Let’s move!</b>

07:03.500 --> 07:04.340
<b>Move your ass!</b>

07:05.250 --> 07:06.750
<b>I got shot! What do you expect?</b>

07:09.800 --> 07:11.010
<b>What the... Wait!</b>

07:12.680 --> 07:13.510
<b>Kid.</b>

07:14.970 --> 07:16.010
<b>You the prayin’ type?</b>

07:17.600 --> 07:19.390
<b>Wait, you can't be... Seriously?!</b>

07:22.020 --> 07:24.150
<b>You promised! Make them stop it!</b>

07:25.020 --> 07:26.400
<b>Makoto! Makoto!</b>

07:28.280 --> 07:30.070
<b>You need to calm yourself.</b>

07:32.160 --> 07:35.280
<b>No!</b>

07:41.460 --> 07:42.870
<b>Hey, head up next time.</b>

07:44.710 --> 07:46.500
<b>You are insane, man!</b>

07:49.510 --> 07:50.340
<b>Ow!</b>

07:50.800 --> 07:52.010
<b>You should be able to walk now.</b>

07:52.550 --> 07:54.340
<b>Okay, what the hell’s your deal?</b>

07:54.970 --> 07:56.800
<b>First you need to answer
my earlier questions.</b>

07:58.180 --> 08:00.140
<b>Now’s not the time! They have Sarah!</b>

08:03.020 --> 08:04.770
<b>I put a tracker on the chopper.</b>

08:05.270 --> 08:06.110
<b>Let's go.</b>

08:06.190 --> 08:07.860
<b>Uh... Nice.</b>

08:13.280 --> 08:15.280
<b>That’s one hell of an entrance.</b>

08:15.740 --> 08:17.620
<b>Yeah. I’m not one for subtlety.</b>

08:19.040 --> 08:19.870
<b>Follow me!</b>

08:19.950 --> 08:22.710
<b>Wait, wait, wait!
Why are we running <i>towards </i>them?</b>

08:23.210 --> 08:24.670
<b>This is insane!</b>

08:25.670 --> 08:27.040
<b><i>They've broken through the front.</i></b>

08:27.130 --> 08:30.420
<b><i>Alpha, Charlie, stay on them.</i>
<i>Delta, seal the mountain path!</i></b>

08:30.510 --> 08:31.340
<b><i>Roger that!</i></b>

08:37.470 --> 08:41.770
<b>Seal off this path.
Use the game trail. Get ahead of them.</b>

08:41.850 --> 08:42.680
<b>Roger that!</b>

08:43.350 --> 08:44.940
<b>They’re both expendable, shoot to kill.</b>

08:51.150 --> 08:52.030
<b>Are they gone?</b>

08:52.110 --> 08:52.940
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:53.400 --> 08:55.030
<b>I bet this path’s probably covered.</b>

08:55.110 --> 08:56.450
<b>Doesn’t matter. Wasn’t the plan.</b>

08:59.660 --> 09:01.660
<b>So you’re a Portal!</b>

09:02.450 --> 09:03.870
<b>Quit stalling, let’s move.</b>

09:03.960 --> 09:04.790
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:05.210 --> 09:07.000
<b>Thanks for the help, Mr. Monk!</b>

09:10.960 --> 09:12.670
<b><i>Sir, the targets have been found.</i></b>

09:13.590 --> 09:17.300
<b>It’s taken you long enough...
now stop them.</b>

09:18.260 --> 09:20.890
<b>Make sure they die this time.
They’re starting to annoy me.</b>

09:20.970 --> 09:21.810
<b><i>Roger!</i></b>

09:25.690 --> 09:26.560
<b>Listen up trash boy.</b>

09:26.640 --> 09:29.940
<b>Once we’re clear of this forest,
you’re gonna tell me everything.</b>

09:34.490 --> 09:36.700
<b>That light! We’re out! Whoa!</b>

09:44.700 --> 09:45.910
<b>Move it, now.</b>

09:46.000 --> 09:46.830
<b>S-Sure.</b>

09:52.250 --> 09:54.960
<b><i>Make sure they die this time.</i>
<i>They’re starting to annoy me.</i></b>

09:55.050 --> 09:55.880
<b>Roger!</b>

09:56.720 --> 09:58.340
<b>I’ll scout from the treeline.</b>

10:02.470 --> 10:04.850
<b>Watch out! They're above us!</b>

10:15.440 --> 10:16.860
<b>Kid, are you...</b>

10:18.240 --> 10:19.450
<b>a Sensitive?</b>

10:22.870 --> 10:23.700
<b>That makes sense.</b>

10:24.950 --> 10:26.160
<b>You can get off of me now.</b>

10:34.750 --> 10:35.590
<b>Get on!</b>

10:35.920 --> 10:38.420
<b>Hey! Why are you doing this?
And who are you?</b>

10:38.880 --> 10:41.760
<b>We can talk when you’re on the damn bike.
Now get on!</b>

10:43.350 --> 10:45.100
<b>Don't you wanna save
your little girlfriend?</b>

10:46.470 --> 10:47.310
<b>Jerk.</b>

10:57.440 --> 11:00.910
<b>Human experiments with Dark XM?
Sounds like ugly stuff.</b>

11:01.700 --> 11:02.530
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:02.620 --> 11:06.620
<b>Hulong’s pushing a huge project forward.
Somehow, Sarah’s the key to it all.</b>

11:07.620 --> 11:08.450
<b>Is that so...</b>

11:09.250 --> 11:10.290
<b>And what about you?</b>

11:11.040 --> 11:14.210
<b>You’re Resistance, right?
Is that why you’re up against Hulong?</b>

11:15.000 --> 11:17.210
<b>You said you can read
an object’s memories, right?</b>

11:17.300 --> 11:18.300
<b>Uh. Yeah?</b>

11:22.840 --> 11:24.850
<b>Was this man at the site of the explosion?</b>

11:27.430 --> 11:28.270
<b>He was.</b>

11:30.270 --> 11:32.440
<b>But it looked like he died
in the explosion.</b>

11:38.650 --> 11:39.530
<b>Who was he?</b>

11:39.780 --> 11:42.450
<b>Christopher Brandt,
a scientist with the Resistance.</b>

11:43.910 --> 11:46.780
<b>Hulong took him, and I’ve been trying
to find him ever since.</b>

11:48.040 --> 11:51.330
<b>I thought your lady friend
might’ve been able to lead me to him.</b>

11:52.670 --> 11:53.500
<b>I see.</b>

11:54.420 --> 11:56.040
<b>Why would Hulong take him?</b>

11:56.630 --> 12:00.050
<b>Haven’t figured that out yet.
Maybe he was trying to stop them, too.</b>

12:01.970 --> 12:04.640
<b>There was a time when Brandt
was working with Hulong.</b>

12:05.050 --> 12:08.640
<b>But he cut ties. And they went after him.</b>

12:09.060 --> 12:10.350
<b>Just like they did with Sarah...</b>

12:11.310 --> 12:13.600
<b>I never knew why
he quit working with them.</b>

12:16.310 --> 12:17.730
<b>But now I think I do.</b>

12:17.820 --> 12:21.150
<b>He said we had to come to Japan
to save humanity from itself.</b>

12:22.240 --> 12:24.660
<b>I think he knew
exactly what they were up to.</b>

12:25.160 --> 12:25.990
<b>So what’ll you do?</b>

12:27.830 --> 12:29.370
<b>Pick up where Brandt left off.</b>

12:30.040 --> 12:31.250
<b>You're going after 'em?</b>

12:34.670 --> 12:37.250
<b>-Get off the bike.
-Huh? Oh, sure.</b>

12:41.960 --> 12:42.800
<b>See ya.</b>

12:43.050 --> 12:45.930
<b>Huh? Wait, wait! Hang on!</b>

12:46.010 --> 12:46.840
<b>Move.</b>

12:46.930 --> 12:48.220
<b>Why should I?</b>

12:48.300 --> 12:49.760
<b>It’s for your own good, kid.</b>

12:50.140 --> 12:52.640
<b>Are you serious? Come on!
You can’t just leave me here!</b>

12:52.730 --> 12:55.600
<b>You told me what I needed to know.
We’re done here.</b>

12:56.350 --> 12:58.610
<b>You’ll only get in my way.</b>

13:00.320 --> 13:03.900
<b>Going up against Hulong,
you'll be screwed without my ability.</b>

13:08.660 --> 13:11.870
<b>If it weren’t for that,
we'd both be dead already.</b>

13:14.710 --> 13:16.500
<b>Damn. I tend not to trust the Enlightened.</b>

13:17.040 --> 13:18.210
<b>Don’t gimme that crap.</b>

13:18.290 --> 13:20.840
<b>Look what we’re up against!
If we don’t fight together...</b>

13:21.380 --> 13:22.210
<b>We are done!</b>

13:26.680 --> 13:27.510
<b>Let go of me.</b>

13:33.180 --> 13:37.310
<b>Let me guess.
You wanna save the world, right?</b>

13:39.480 --> 13:42.980
<b>Not at all. I just want to save Sarah.</b>

13:52.790 --> 13:53.620
<b>Get on.</b>

13:57.830 --> 13:59.630
<b>Look. Here’s the tracker’s location.</b>

14:00.580 --> 14:04.920
<b>Kansai Airport? If they leave the country,
we’ll never find ‘em!</b>

14:06.090 --> 14:08.300
<b>Then we better make damn sure
that doesn’t happen.</b>

14:12.470 --> 14:14.600
<b>Commander Liu. The charter jet is ready.</b>

14:15.060 --> 14:15.890
<b>Good.</b>

14:16.480 --> 14:18.390
<b>And the two Agents are heading towards us.</b>

14:18.480 --> 14:20.900
<b>Just keep them away from the plane.</b>

14:29.660 --> 14:31.160
<b>What the hell is going on?</b>

14:32.120 --> 14:34.490
<b>Hulong’s got the local cops
in their pockets.</b>

14:36.410 --> 14:38.540
<b>I’ve got a few tricks of my own.</b>

14:46.130 --> 14:49.340
<b><i>Targets sighted! Heading down</i>
<i>the main street towards Tarui!</i></b>

14:57.890 --> 14:59.100
<b>Have a nice nap?</b>

15:00.850 --> 15:01.690
<b>Where am I?</b>

15:02.560 --> 15:04.820
<b>Care for a drink? My treat.</b>

15:05.400 --> 15:07.570
<b>Where's Makoto?
What did you do to him?!</b>

15:10.240 --> 15:11.070
<b>Where are we going...</b>

15:15.620 --> 15:17.330
<b>Where are you planning on taking me?</b>

15:17.410 --> 15:18.750
<b>Where it all started.</b>

15:19.500 --> 15:22.210
<b>There’s something there
that we need your assistance with.</b>

15:23.830 --> 15:29.210
<b>How about we toast to the success
of our project. Cheers.</b>

15:45.480 --> 15:46.320
<b>Makoto...</b>

15:47.070 --> 15:47.900
<b>Sarah!</b>

15:48.320 --> 15:51.030
<b>-What is it now?
-There! They’ve got Sarah on that plane!</b>

15:52.240 --> 15:53.070
<b>How can you tell?</b>

15:53.490 --> 15:56.740
<b>I heard her!
Her voice was coming from up there!</b>

15:57.080 --> 15:59.410
<b>I’m sure of it! Come on!
We need to catch up! Move!</b>

16:00.160 --> 16:03.120
<b>Stop it, you idiot!
You can’t chase a plane on a bike!</b>

16:03.210 --> 16:04.420
<b>Please!</b>

16:10.800 --> 16:12.840
<b>Flight Radar. It’ll show us their route.</b>

16:14.130 --> 16:15.470
<b>Bravo 25735.</b>

16:16.720 --> 16:18.970
<b>Damn, a charter.
Can’t figure out the destination.</b>

16:19.890 --> 16:22.020
<b>It doesn’t matter anyway.
We’re wanted men.</b>

16:22.980 --> 16:24.900
<b>No way we’re getting on
a commercial flight.</b>

16:25.730 --> 16:28.320
<b>Our passports would
give us away instantly.</b>

16:28.770 --> 16:29.610
<b>I know...</b>

16:31.490 --> 16:34.410
<b>Jack, listen. I’ve got an idea.
Take me to this location.</b>

16:35.200 --> 16:37.320
<b>Trust me. I’ve got a solution.</b>

16:39.950 --> 16:40.790
<b>Oh goody.</b>

16:46.710 --> 16:47.540
<b>A manga...</b>

16:49.840 --> 16:50.670
<b>Cafe?</b>

16:55.590 --> 16:56.930
<b>Kill me now.</b>

17:00.390 --> 17:01.470
<b>I’m over here, Jack.</b>

17:05.060 --> 17:06.060
<b>What’re you looking up?</b>

17:07.310 --> 17:10.480
<b>Airport server has all arrival
and departure information.</b>

17:10.570 --> 17:11.400
<b>I’m borrowing some.</b>

17:12.780 --> 17:14.110
<b>You know your way around.</b>

17:15.110 --> 17:16.910
<b>I used to do this for a living.</b>

17:17.660 --> 17:18.990
<b>You were... a hacker?</b>

17:19.780 --> 17:24.040
<b>Couldn’t hold a regular job.
And it kept me clear of other people.</b>

17:29.040 --> 17:31.210
<b>Here’s the data...
They're going to Switzerland.</b>

17:32.300 --> 17:33.130
<b>Switzerland...</b>

17:34.590 --> 17:36.510
<b>Now to wrangle ourselves up
some passports.</b>

17:37.970 --> 17:40.510
<b>It’ll all depend on if our man’s
in a giving mood.</b>

17:40.930 --> 17:42.680
<b>-Our man?
-Yeah.</b>

17:43.350 --> 17:45.890
<b>An old friend of mine.
He’s a counterfeiter.</b>

17:47.310 --> 17:51.320
<b>I'M LOOKING FOR AN OLD FRIEND
WITH AN APPETITE.</b>

17:51.400 --> 17:52.730
<b>THAT REALLY YOU MAKO?</b>

17:52.900 --> 17:53.730
<b>It’s him!</b>

17:54.690 --> 17:58.660
<b>BEEN AGES. HEARD YOU'D GONE STRAIGHT.
LOST YOUR EDGE.</b>

17:59.280 --> 18:01.120
<b>I got you now, Zion.</b>

18:02.660 --> 18:05.410
<b>SHARP AS EVER. ARE YOU?
NEED TWO PASSPORTS ASAP.</b>

18:12.040 --> 18:14.760
<b>Two passports on the double?
How much can you pay?</b>

18:16.130 --> 18:18.130
<b>Bastard, you really don’t ever change.</b>

18:20.470 --> 18:22.350
<b>MY CREDIT STILL GOOD?</b>

18:22.810 --> 18:23.760
<b>Huh?</b>

18:27.640 --> 18:29.140
<b>Hey hacker, your friend’s gone quiet.</b>

18:32.940 --> 18:34.650
<b>MY CREDIT STILL GOOD?</b>

18:34.730 --> 18:37.360
<b>OK, BUT I CHARGE INTEREST.
PICS. PRINTS. 24H DELIVERY.</b>

18:37.740 --> 18:38.570
<b>All right!</b>

18:41.620 --> 18:43.280
<b>Is this guy someone we can trust?</b>

18:45.450 --> 18:47.250
<b>Yeah, he’s a total pro.</b>

18:48.370 --> 18:50.460
<b>Just gotta send this to him
and we’re on our way.</b>

18:51.790 --> 18:52.630
<b>Whatever.</b>

18:53.000 --> 18:54.340
<b>Wait a sec! Where you going?</b>

18:54.800 --> 18:55.630
<b>Coffee.</b>

18:56.710 --> 18:57.550
<b>"Coffee."</b>

18:58.380 --> 19:00.510
<b>"Thanks! Great job, man... “ There.</b>

19:27.700 --> 19:30.160
<b>This is surprisingly good coffee.</b>

19:35.710 --> 19:39.170
<b>GOLGO 13</b>

19:49.430 --> 19:50.270
<b>Rise and shine.</b>

19:50.810 --> 19:51.810
<b>How long was I asleep?</b>

19:52.560 --> 19:53.600
<b>About six hours.</b>

19:55.310 --> 19:56.150
<b>Sorry.</b>

19:57.480 --> 20:00.360
<b>Don’t be. I can’t wait to find out
what happens next.</b>

20:04.910 --> 20:07.450
<b>Take these. They’re for you.</b>

20:08.870 --> 20:09.700
<b>Contact lenses?</b>

20:11.080 --> 20:14.460
<b>XM Optical Scanners.
Grabbed ‘em off a Hulong thug.</b>

20:15.580 --> 20:18.750
<b>Whoa... I can see the XM.</b>

20:19.760 --> 20:21.970
<b>That’s right.
They’re a Christopher Brandt original.</b>

20:23.880 --> 20:26.850
<b>I’m gonna rest. Wake me up if you need me.</b>

20:27.640 --> 20:28.470
<b>Hey...</b>

20:29.310 --> 20:30.140
<b>What now?</b>

20:30.270 --> 20:33.060
<b>This Christopher Brandt guy.
Was he special to you?</b>

20:34.730 --> 20:36.980
<b>He was... the man who saved my life.</b>

20:53.830 --> 20:55.620
<b>I can walk by my damn self!</b>

20:56.500 --> 20:59.340
<b>Gently, please.
She’s an important asset to our research.</b>

20:59.420 --> 21:00.250
<b>Of course, sir.</b>

21:04.720 --> 21:05.550
<b>Makoto...</b>

21:23.820 --> 21:24.650
<b>Sarah...</b>

22:53.910 --> 22:55.910
<b>Subtitle Translation by Rika Takahashi</b>
